## Build Order (jo already follow kar raha hai, yahi sahi hai)

1. ✅ **Auth** — Register/Login/Logout/Forgot-Reset Password (JWT + cookies)
2. ✅ **Collections** — backend + frontend + filters + facets + slug routing
3. 🔶 **Products** — CRUD done backend side, image upload abhi test ho raha hai
4. 🔶 **Cart** — slice bana hai, UI/dispatch wiring abhi test ho raha hai
5. 🔶 **Wishlist** — heart toggle + backend sync, abhi test ho raha hai
6. ⬜ **Checkout / Razorpay** — pending
7. ⬜ **Order history** — pending
8. ⬜ **Admin panel UI** — routes/guards ban chuke hain, actual dashboard pages pending

