## Naming Conventions (khud ke liye consistent rakhna)

- **Files**: `PascalCase.jsx` components ke liye, `camelCase.js` services/slices/utils ke liye
- **Redux slices**: hamesha `{ items/data, loading, mutating, error }` shape follow kar — jaisa wishlistSlice mein kiya
- **API services**: ek file = ek resource (`cartService.js` sirf cart-related calls karega)
- **Routes ka order matter karta hai**: specific route (`/collections/:collectionSlug`) generic route (`/:identifier`) se **pehle** likhna — warna generic route usko match kar lega

