## ⚠️ Abhi ke Known Issues (fix karne hain)

1. `app.js` aur `server.js` dono almost identical hain — `app.js` **dead code** hai kyunki `package.json` sirf `server.js` run karta hai. Ek hata de, confusion se bachega.
2. `ApiError.js` do jagah hai — `utils/ApiError.js` aur `validator/utils/ApiError.js`. Ek hi rakho, sab imports usi pe point karo.
3. `createProduct` controller mein `variants` ko `JSON.parse()` karna hai (form-data se string aata hai)
4. `PUT /:id` (product update) route mein `upload.array("images", 5)` middleware missing hai
5. Collection ke andar product add karna **manual type** ke liye `products[]` array mein ID push karna padta hai — `isFeatured` field ka `/collections/:slug` route se koi lena-dena nahi (wo alag `/products/collections/:slug` route ke liye hai)

